WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Banana-Zucchini Bread. 70 min · 20 servings · American

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ingredients: 11. 4 large eggs, room temperature; 2 cups sugar; 1 cup vegetable oil (or sub applesauce 1 cup); 2 medium ripe bananas, mashed (about 1 cup)

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 1. In a bowl, beat eggs. Blend in sugar and oil. Add bananas and mix well.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 2. Combine the flour, baking powder, baking soda, cinnamon and salt; stir into egg mixture. Stir in zucchini and pecans just until combined.

5
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Step 3. Pour into two greased 9x5-in. loaf pans. Bake at 350°F for 50 minutes or until a toothpick comes out clean.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4. Cool for 10 minutes. Remove from pans to wire racks to cool completely.

7
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
You're ready. Use Make It for checkboxes on the page.
